{
 "id": "story-israelittene-gar-gjennom-rodehavet-gospel",
 "song": "/Users/vhanssen/WebstormProjects/flogvit/music/YuE/outputs/catalog/story-israelittene-gar-gjennom-rodehavet-gospel",
 "offset_seconds": -1.7600000000002183,
 "words_heard": 237,
 "words": 243,
 "lines": [
  {
   "text": "Pharaoh's chariots behind us and the sea before our face",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.73,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Israel cried out to the LORD, there was no hiding place",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.31,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Was it for want of graves in Egypt that you brought us here to die",
   "heard": 14,
   "words": 15,
   "error_s": 0.8,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "But Moses answered all the people with his staff held high",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.25,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Do not be afraid",
   "heard": 4,
   "words": 4,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Stand firm and see the deliverance the LORD will bring you today",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.6,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD will fight for you",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 1.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "You need only be still",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.91,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": true
  },
  {
   "text": "Moses stretched his hand out and the east wind blew all night",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.7,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The waters were divided and the pillar gave them light",
   "heard": 10,
   "words": 10,
   "error_s": 0.62,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "They walked through on dry ground with a wall on either hand",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "And when the morning came they were standing on the farther sand",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.63,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "I will sing to the LORD, for he is highly exalted",
   "heard": 11,
   "words": 11,
   "error_s": 0.51,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Horse and rider he hurled into the sea",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.58,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "The LORD is my strength and my song",
   "heard": 8,
   "words": 8,
   "error_s": 0.3,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He has become my salvation",
   "heard": 5,
   "words": 5,
   "error_s": 0.38,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through the sea on dry ground",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.45,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "Through the sea on dry ground",
   "heard": 6,
   "words": 6,
   "error_s": 0.53,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "With a wall of water on their right and on their left",
   "heard": 12,
   "words": 12,
   "error_s": 0.2,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
   "text": "He is my God, and I will praise him",
   "heard": 9,
   "words": 9,
   "error_s": 0.47,
   "tie_split": false,
   "uncertain": false
  },
  {
